  - m_Id: 688525312
    m_Localized: The surrounding area has been scanned for lifeform signals and anomalies
      and mapped accordingly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 743051264
    m_Localized: "[End Time] has been identified in classified data \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 514058752000
    m_Localized: '[End Time] is classified as top-priority information and will be
      displayed at the top of the screen.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 653557108736
    m_Localized: "It is recorded as the time remaining until the end of \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0.\nThe
      related data is damaged, so further details cannot be accessed."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1882102304768
    m_Localized: "[End Time] has been identified in classified data \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0.\n[End
      Time] is classified as top-priority information and will be displayed at the
